      <h2>1. What WorkLog is</h2>
      <p>WorkLog helps you keep a personal record of your freelance clients, projects, work, time, invoices and finances. It is an organizational tool. It is not legal, accounting, tax, financial, medical or nutrition advice.</p>

      <h2>2. Who can use WorkLog</h2>
