        <li>Please do not share your account with others. WorkLog support will never ask you for your password or verification codes.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Your content and data</h2>
      <p>"Your Content" means everything you add to WorkLog, including client details, projects, work entries, invoices, income and expenses, reminders, notes, photos and optional Gym and Diet records.</p>
