      <h2>6. Online invoice links</h2>
      <p>When you create and share an online invoice link, you authorize anyone who has that link to view the invoice details shown on that page. A link is a private token, not an identity check. You are responsible for sharing it only with the intended person and for the information included in the invoice. If a link was shared by mistake, contact us and we will help you disable it.</p>

      <h2>7. Optional features</h2>
      <p><strong>Gym and Diet.</strong> This module is optional and provided for personal record keeping only. It does not give medical, fitness or nutrition advice. Talk to a qualified professional before making health decisions.</p>
      <p><strong>AI assistant.</strong> The assistant is optional, requires your consent, and can be turned off in Profile. Its suggestions and drafts are generated automatically and may be incomplete or wrong. They are not professional advice. Review everything before you act on it or send it to a client. You are responsible for the choices you make.</p>

